            "block_content": "[V2G20-1580] After receiving the CertificateInstallationRes with EVSEProcessing set to \"Finished\" and ResponseCode starting with \"WARNING\", the EVCC shall ignore all other parameters of the response message and shall do one (1) of the following.",
